><div>V <b data-val=\"mppt4Volt\">--</b></div><div>A <b data-val=\"mppt4Amp\">--</b></div></div><div class=\"mppt\" data-mppt=\"5\"><strong>INV3 MPPT1</strong><div>P <b data-val=\"mppt5Power\">--</b></div><div>V <b data-val=\"mppt5Volt\">--</b></div><div>A <b data-val=\"mppt5Amp\">--</b></div></div><div class=\"mppt\" data-mppt=\"6\"><strong>INV3 MPPT2</strong><div>P <b data-val=\"mppt6Power\">--</b></div><div>V <b data-val=\"mppt6Volt\">--</b></div><div>A <b data-val=\"mppt6Amp\">--</b></div></div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"bottomPanel\"><h3 class=\"headStatus\"><span>Onduleur</span><span class=\"statusGroup\"><b class=\"status\" data-val=\"invFault\">OK</b><b class=\"status\" data-val=\"invWarn\">OK</b></span></h3><div class=\"dataRows\"><div><span>Sortie AC</span><b data-val=\"acVolt\">--</b></div><div><span>Fréquence</span><b data-val=\"acHz\">--</b></div><div><span>Courant sortie</span><b data-val=\"acAmp\">--</b></div></div></div>\n    </footer>\n    <section class=\"pageView pageEnergy\">\n      <div class=\"svPagePanel\">\n        <h2 class=\"svPageTitle\">⇄ Énergies</h2>\n        <div class=\"svSubnav\"><button class=\"svSubtab active\" data-period=\"day\">Jour</button><button class=\"svSubtab\" data-period=\"month\">Mois</button><button class=\"svSubtab\" data-period=\"year\">Année</button><button class=\"svSubtab\" data-period=\"total\">Total</button></div>\n        <div class=\"svCards\" id=\"energyCards\"></div>\n        <div class=\"svChart\" id=\"energyChart\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</div>\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"settingsModal\">\n  <div class=\"dialog\">\n    <h2>Paramètres</h2>\n    <div class=\"hint\">Les capteurs renseignés ici passent avant les capteurs Energy automatiques. Mets une entité par ligne quand il y en a plusieurs.</div>\n    <div class=\"settingsTabs\"><button class=\"active\" data-settings-tab=\"solar\">Solaire</button><button data-settings-tab=\"home\">Maison</button><button data-settings-tab=\"bat